89 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (The inaugural session of Capacity Building Programme on Policy and Regulatory Aspects of Electricity Distribution brought together officials from various DISCOMs for an engaging learning and knowledge-sharing programme. The session commenced with a welcome address and introduction to the programme by Dr. Brijesh Bhatt, Faculty, NSB. This was followed by an address by Dr. R. Gopichandran, Officiating Director, NSB who emphasized the importance of capacity building in strengthening the electricity distribution sector. Participants from various DISCOMs were subsequently introduced. The inaugural session was graced by Shri Ashok Rathore, CGM, RDSS, who addressed the participants and highlighted the importance of strengthening the capabilities of DISCOM officials to effectively address emerging challenges in the electricity distribution sector. This was followed by a keynote address by Shri A. K. Pandey, CGM \(Commercial\), NTPC Ltd., who shared valuable insights on the commercial and operational aspects of electricity distribution. Ms. Rachana Singh Bhal, ED \(PMI\), NTPC Ltd. and Chairperson, Governance Committee, NSB, also addressed the gathering and emphasised the importance of continuous learning and capacity enhancement for effective sectoral transformation. The occasion was further enriched by the presence of Shri Sanjay Kumar, DGM, HRD, RDSS, and Shri Raja Ramesh, Manager, HRD, RDSS, whose participation added significance to the inaugural programme. The session concluded with the way forward and vote of thanks by Dr. A.P. Dash, Professor, NSB, marking the successful commencement of the capacity-building initiative.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
