/P 54 0 R
/E (The session focused on the application of a zero-coding platform for analysing qualitative data in a systematic, efficient, and user-friendly manner. Prof. Shiv provided participants with practical insights into the process of organising, analysing, and interpreting qualitative data, with emphasis on how digital tools can support researchers in deriving meaningful insights without extensive programming or coding expertise.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
104 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (The programme was highly interactive, with participants actively engaging in discussions, raising questions, and sharing their research experiences. The session facilitated meaningful academic exchange and highlighted the growing relevance of technology in contemporary research practices.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
